# Built APK, stashed here (NOT in public/) so `vite build`/`cap sync`
# never bundle it into the web assets synced into the Android project —
# doing that self-embeds the previous release's APK inside the next one,
# doubling its size every rebuild. Copied into dist/ only as the very
# last step before deploying (see the release pipeline). Not part of the
# repo.
artifacts/game-lobby/release/*.apk
